  "2026-09-17T16:26:23.948Z","harness:codex","TDD baseline: seven inherited-container and hostile-path cases fail before the fix. Nested settings reads expose inherited values and writes can traverse prototype objects. Reject unsafe segments before any mutation and define local own data properties."
  "2026-09-17T16:55:19.981Z","harness:codex","Final targeted Semgrep verification: the original prototype-pollution-loop rule now returns zero findings and zero scan errors across nested settings, linked-test execution and the extracted JSON-path reader. No Semgrep suppressions or gate exceptions were introduced. Regression coverage exercises inherited containers, sparse array slots and accessors while preserving ordinary own JSON data."
  "2026-09-17T17:24:14.424Z","harness:codex","Final local delivery evidence: full suite 8963 tests across 704 files passed; exact coverage statements 64703/64703, branches 49357/49357, functions 13438/13438, lines 61937/61937. Linked tests, Semgrep, secret scan, dependency audit, static correctness gates, unchanged idle-host performance limits, graph and record integrity, package-first dogfood and packed consumers passed. Hosted review and CI remain the next delivery stage."
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-17T16:34:19.092Z","harness:codex",An own-property check prevents inherited reads but ordinary property access can still invoke getters. Read own data descriptors and reject unsafe write-path segments before creating any intermediate container.
